    "principles": [
      "No protocol/framework mutation for experimental convenience.",
      "No stochastic rerun as repair.",
      "No automatic second repair after a poor first result.",
      "Preserve-set integrity and repair legality are measured separately from downstream efficacy.",
      "Source readiness, execution legality and downstream effect are distinct gates.",
      "Terminal outcome remains a separate indicator rather than the definition of process repair success."
